# Secrets. Production values live in Cloudflare's secret store
# (wrangler secret put), never in the repo. These are the local equivalents.
#   .dev.vars  -- what `wrangler dev` reads for Worker secrets
#   .env*      -- what Vite reads; kept out too, in case one is ever added
